{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And you shall sound a second teru'ah, and the camps encamping southward shall set out.</b> For those who carried the Sanctuary traveled with them." "<b>A teru'ah they shall sound for their journeys.</b> For their journey includes both a teqi'ah and a teru'ah — the teru'ah being for the transporting of the Sanctuary, and the teqi'ah together with it for their own journeying, so that they gather together, as were the assembly and the princes summoned by a teqi'ah without teru'ah."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:13.137079569Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}